==Swedish==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|non|sv}} {{term|í gær|lang=non}}, {{term|í gjár||yesterday|lang=non}} (whence {{etyl|is|-}} {{term|í gær|lang=is}} and {{etyl|fo|-}} {{term|í gjár|lang=fo}}). Akin to {{compound|i|går|lang=sv}}.

